# wip610: RANDOM ALL VOICES: SEL (PITCH MOD page, view 11), K4 = the purple RNDM button: FUNC (key b10 in scenarios) held + turn K4 = a new safe random sound for ALL 8 voices.
# K4 alone only warns; level and pan of every voice stay; distortion never above 3/4 of its range; no zoom on K4; the VEL page's RANDOM SOUND still changes one voice only. Both skins.
wait 300
tap SEL
expect view 11
shot randomall_idle.png
expect sound0.0.17 101
expect sound0.5.17 101
expect sound0.0.21 64
expect sound0.7.21 64
turn K4 1 80
shot randomall_warn.png
